text: "Jordan Reyes\nChicago, IL · jordan.reyes@example.com · (312) 555-0147\n\nSummary\nSoftware engineer with 3 years of software development in Go: distributed systems, machine learning ranking and the reliability of production services.\n\nExperience\nSoftware Engineer, Brightline Labs, Chicago, IL, 2023 to present\n- Rebuilt the payments API in Go, cutting p99 latency 38% across 4M requests a day\n- Shipped an ML ranking service that lifted search click-through 12%\n- Led on-call for 9 services and cut pages 60% with automated runbooks\n- Ran design reviews with product and finance stakeholders for the payments rebuild that serves 4M requests a day\n- Moved all 9 of our services onto Kubernetes on Google Cloud Platform as Docker containers\n\nSoftware Engineering Intern, Brightline Labs, Chicago, IL, Summer 2022\n- Built an internal dashboard for tracking support tickets\n\nEducation\nUniversity of Michigan, B.S.E. in Computer Science, 2023\nCoursework: data structures, distributed computing, operating systems\n\nSkills\nGo, Python, SQL, PostgreSQL, Kubernetes, Docker containers, Google Cloud Platform, machine learning, code reviews, unit testing, debugging, monitoring, performance profiling, reliability\n"
